                                "sense_id": "bfea10d7-cbd3-322b-aae7-2cf888b3defe",
                                "text": "Remark, in any case, what somersets and contortions a dead Catholicism is making,—skilfully galvanised: hideous, and even piteous, to behold!"
                            },
                            {
